{"title":"Career roadmap — Relationship Executive","role":"Relationship Executive","summary":"A Relationship Executive in banking and insurance manages customer relationships, understands financial needs, explains suitable products, supports account and policy services, generates leads, and contributes to customer retention and business growth.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM","Course":"BBA – Banking & Insurance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong entry-level career for students who enjoy finance + sales + communication + customer interaction. The best long-term professionals combine relationship management with financial knowledge, digital banking, analytics and compliance."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build banking, insurance, sales, customer-service, financial-product and CRM skills; enter as Relationship Executive/Officer."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress to Senior Relationship Executive, Relationship Manager, Branch Sales Officer or Priority Banking Executive."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move into Branch Manager, Wealth Relationship Manager, Corporate Relationship Manager or Insurance Sales Manager roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead branches, wealth portfolios, corporate banking relationships, insurance distribution or become a regional/business head."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Banking and business foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of banking"},{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Banking products"},{"text":"Insurance fundamentals"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Sales fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Savings accounts"},{"text":"Current accounts"},{"text":"Fixed deposits"},{"text":"Recurring deposits"},{"text":"Loans"},{"text":"Credit cards"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"Insurance policies"},{"text":"Digital banking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Banking + relationship management"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail banking operations"},{"text":"KYC fundamentals"},{"text":"AML awareness"},{"text":"Customer onboarding"},{"text":"Loan application process"},{"text":"Credit fundamentals"},{"text":"Insurance underwriting concepts"},{"text":"Claims process"},{"text":"Financial planning basics"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Cross-selling"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"CRM platforms"},{"text":"Power BI basics"},{"text":"Banking/insurance software"},{"text":"Digital banking platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Financial advisory + sales excellence"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statement basics"},{"text":"Credit analysis"},{"text":"Loan eligibility assessment"},{"text":"Risk profiling"},{"text":"Investment products"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"Insurance planning"},{"text":"Portfolio basics"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"},{"text":"Relationship analytics"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Financial product presentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer profile","Financial need","Risk","Suitable product","Compliance","Customer relationship"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Industry-ready preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build practical projects such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Customer Relationship Management Dashboard"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segments"},{"tex